00:59:22.040 --> 00:59:24.790
as well as Chris Mink.

00:59:24.790 --> 00:59:29.583
So yeah, you've drawn quite
the crowd, Professor Crull.

00:59:30.436 --> 00:59:33.620
(laughs) So I think...

00:59:35.120 --> 00:59:39.080
And I also have greetings
