- [Yemima] I think.

01:09:40.582 --> 01:09:41.530
Do you want me to ask them?

01:09:41.530 --> 01:09:42.420
- Just a shout out, yeah.

01:09:42.420 --> 01:09:44.000
Yemima, please go ahead, yeah.

01:09:44.000 --> 01:09:45.890
- Yeah, so just to...

01:09:45.890 --> 01:09:48.707
First of all, thanks,
fascinating description

01:09:48.707 --> 01:09:50.483
