01:18:05.090 --> 01:18:06.720
- Okay, great.

01:18:06.720 --> 01:18:11.540
So I think at this point,
we should just then wrap up

01:18:11.540 --> 01:18:14.390
with looking forward to tomorrow's

01:18:15.370 --> 01:18:20.080
really wonderful discussion
where we can learn more.

01:18:20.080 --> 01:18:23.803
Thank you, Elise, so much for
