01:18:39.070 --> 01:18:41.450
And whether...

01:18:41.450 --> 01:18:44.700
Are we being extremely optimistic

01:18:44.700 --> 01:18:47.790
or is that just a completely
different functional realm?

01:18:47.790 --> 01:18:49.820
If you can get it to
